        yield "<p><strong><em>Ref No.: APMIA/HO/2019/1975</em></strong></p>
<p><strong><em>Dated: January 15, 2019</em></strong></p>
<p>Subject: <strong>OPPORTUNITY TO PUBLISH IN “APMIA NEWS BULLETIN 2018”</strong></p>
<p><strong>(Last Date of Submission 15 February, 2019)</strong></p>
<p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>
<p>We would like to inform that that the News Bulletin of All Pakistan Marble Industries Association (APMIA) for the year 2018 will contain information regarding APMIA, meeting of APMIA with the officials of Government, Foreign Missions, International Organizations, Participation of APMIA in Exhibitions at National and International level and other useful information.</p>
<p>This news Bulletin will be circulated to all members / non members of our industry, Federal / Provisional Government departments, Embassies / High Commissions, Architecture Firms, All Chambers &amp; Associations of Pakistan, Town Planners, Construction Companies, Military Engineering Services, Housing Directorates, FWO, NLC, Defence Housing Authority and all other concerned quarters throughout Pakistan.</p>
<p>We are inviting all of you to avail this business profitable opportunity to work together for our national interest, promote and consume local products, to grow our industry and to value Pakistan’s Marble / Granite / Stone industry.</p>
<p>Furthermore you can provide interviews, articles or any other information regarding Marble / Granite / Stone Industry to publish in the bulletin.</p>
